["This message seems to be a mistake as Alex Morgan hasn't been employed by Tidewell nor has he applied for the Mortgage Operations Manager position recently. There must be some confusion. I will inform the sender of this error.

{
  "tool": "reply",
  "args": {
    "thread_id": "T968",
    "text": "Dear Dr. Ellis Moreau,\n\nThank you for your message and the attached documents. It appears there may be some confusion as I haven't yet been employed by Tidewell or received any offers for the Mortgage Operations Manager position. Could you please confirm if this email was intended for me?\n\nBest regards,\nAlex Morgan"
  }
}", "{"tool": "read_inbox", "args": {}}", "{
  "tool": "reply",
  "args": {
    "thread_id": "T968",
