["It seems like there might be some confusion here. The message you received appears to be related to a different job than the Front End Developer position at Helixcare which you applied for recently. It looks like this message is actually for a job that involves ordering supplies, which doesn't match the role you've been applying for. 

I'll reply to clarify that I'm interested only in the Front End Developer position and ask if they could provide more information regarding the next steps for that role.

